      "id": "start-with-real-failures",
      "heading": "Start with real failures",
      "ordered": false,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "ordered-list",
          "items": [
            "**Start:** use `evals-start` to route toward pipeline auditing or trace review.",
            "**Learn:** inspect varied traces; describe failures and acceptable answers.",
            "**Measure:** use code for objective checks; validate subjective LLM judges against held-out human labels.",
            "**Improve:** fix recurring failures, rerun checks, and add new real cases."
