          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Repository scan: **55/HIGH**, from README false positives and an unpinned installer advisory. Local Codex found no malicious instructions; `error-discovery` needs explicit trace-rendering sanitization. Registry audits: September 1 or 24–25; commit correspondence is unverified. Dependencies/CDNs and runtime behavior remain unreviewed. PASS does not prove safety. [Triage and evidence](/data/security-reviews/evals-skills/2026-09-30/review-notes.md)."
